erves the probe;\n  * a budget-timeout row is classified as terminal \"timeout\" and reported as a\n    named delegation timeout quoting the budget;\n  * delegation_events is an upsert, so a budget-timeout row is given the\n    declared projection margin to be superseded -- correlation id 0df23c72\n    projected empty at 05:56:37.886Z and the real terminal, 77/1819 tokens and\n    the gate passed, landed 12.9 seconds later over the top of it;\n  * timeout-minutes goes 45 -> 70, and scripts/ci/check_nightly_corpus_budget.py\n    recomputes the ceiling from the corpus, the contract and the overlay using\n    the probe's own arithmetic and fails if the budget is below it -- a job\n    cancelled mid-corpus skips its if: always() uploads and leaves a red night\n    with no scoreboard, which is AC3 failing by another route.\n\nWired as the nightly-corpus-budget pre-commit hook AND\ntests/test_delegation_nightly_budget.py inside the required pytest job, same\npredicate both sides.\n\nFalsification controls run, each restored byte-identical afterwards: restoring\nthe fan-out publish turns the interleave test RED at \"assert 9 <= 1\"; restoring\nthe old terminal default reproduces the live misreport string verbatim;\nremoving the supersession window returns the stale empty row; restoring the\nother node's completion bound turns both deadline tests RED and drives the\nderived ceiling from 59 to 158 minutes. Committed positive controls cover an\nundeclared concurrency, an ordinary row still reading \"completed\", a never-\nsuperseded row, and a budget above the ceiling.\n\npre-commit run --all-files exit 0 across 92 hooks, mypy src/ --strict clean.","tree":{"sha":"856a43d8274b3fca5dab7cc24963b38b38db2b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/git/trees/856a43d8274b3fca5dab7cc24963b38b38db2b52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OmniNode-ai/omnimarket/git/commits/65c237cdc914a6c7c1e15de308986ec65c24f309","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"